# the same functions with escape analysis withheld: nothing is known to be fresh, so every resolution is the operation as written
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Folding
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: ResolvePromise
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Folding
# NEVER-NOT: FulfillFreshPromise
# RUN(LOOP): walk f6 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Folding+EscapeAnalysis
# LOOP-NOT: = IsNotThenable
# PROGRAM-OF: promise-that-nothing-has-taken-is-fulfilled-by-a-store.ir
